# ouroboros#185 (round 117): a post-loop read of a module name bound ONLY as
# a for binder. The VM loop-scopes the binder and has no outer `i`; HEAD read
# the file-scope static's 0 at rc 0. The binder writes its C block-local, the
# static's bit is never set, and the post-loop read dies like the VM.
t is 0
for i in range of 3:
    t is t + i
print of t
print of i
print of "unreachable"
